/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (RISGNMUN'26 is more than just a simulation; it is a transformative experience that ignites intellectual curiosity and hones the art of negotiation, rhetoric, and policy-making. It serves as a launchpad for aspiring diplomats, equipping them with the skills to navigate complex global challenges with confidence and integrity. With meticulously curated committees, thought-provoking agendas, and an environment that fosters collaboration, RISGNMUN'26 empowers delegates to redefine possibilities and take decisive steps toward a more just, secure, and prosperous world.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
